/P 169 0 R
/E ( A high-functioning techie who ironically trusts technology the least. By day, Cryst navigates complex cloud infrastructures on Arch Linux; by night, they are a "Neo-Luddite" who disconnects completely. Obsessed with workflow optimization \(using Colemak-DH and Vim\), they view learning shorthand not as a chore, but as the ultimate "life hack" for speed and encryption.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [9]
>>
